erity\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"AC-7.1 to AC-7.3 refer to 'movement quantities', 'cost fields' and 'nutritional fields', and AC-7.2 to lb units, with no contract anchor naming those fields or units.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-7\",\n   \"rubric\": 5,\n   \"severity\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"The spec does not say whether PATCH /rations/{rationId} after feeding events have been recorded recalculates those past events' consumption and cost or leaves them as recorded.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-7\",\n   \"rubric\": 6,\n   \"severity\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"AC-8.1 to AC-8.4 and AC-8.7 hardcode a 409 status, and AC-8.6 assumes a 'Voided' status, inventoryMovements and lotFeedTotals, none anchored to the contract; if createFeedingEvent declares a different status, the requirement breaks I-1.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"rubric\": 5,\n   \"severity\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"No behaviour is defined for voiding an event that is already voided (risk of a double inventory reversal) or for PATCHing a voided event.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"rubric\": 6,\n   \"severity\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"AC-9.1 to AC-9.6 require JSON null for adg, feedConversionRatio, costOfGain and projectedShipDate without showing the contract declares them nullable; if it does not, this conflicts with REQ-1's 'without deviation'.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-9\",\n   \"rubric\": 1,\n   \"severity\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"AC-9.3 hedges on field names ('feedConversionRatio or fcr', 'costOfGain or costPerGain'), so the response schema it relies on is unanchored and unverified.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"REQ-9\",\n   \"rubric\": 5,\n   \"severity\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"finding\": \"The EARS adds 'or no positive gain remains toward the target' (a lot at or above target weight gets no ship date), which goes beyond Q-5; Q-5 only covered zero Days on Feed and zero or negative ADG.\",\n   \"reqId\": \"RE