entory.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response event shows each ingredient's consumed as-fed quantity and a cost equal to the sum of as-fed ingredient quantities multiplied by their unit costs, while nutrition values reflect dry-matter data.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client records a feeding event through POST /api/feeding-events.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a ration defines ingredient proportions, the Feedlot Operations API shall calculate ingredient consumption and ration cost from as-fed ingredient weights and use dry-matter values only for nutritional calculations.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-7\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"Q-3\",\n    \"I-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An ingredient has less available inventory than a proposed feeding event requires and inventory and lot rollup values have been recorded.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 409 and the inventory row, feeding-event row count, and lot feed totals remain unchanged.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client posts the feeding event.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Inventory contains less than the required quantity of at least one ingredient for a feeding event.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 409, no feeding-event row or inventory-movement row is added, and inventory quantities and lot feed and cost rollup values remain unchanged.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client submits the event to the createFeedingEvent operation.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A test-created ration and inventory where one ingredient has less stock than the event requires, with recorded pre-request inventory and lot totals.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 409, no event row exists for the rejected request, the inventory row